  "story": {
    "language": "en",
    "translationLanguage": "zh-Hant",
    "textEn": "At school, our teacher gives each group a small job. I sit on a chair and move close to the desk. There is a notebook, a pencil, and a ruler before me. We are busy making a little house out of paper. I write our idea while the other student draws. We discuss the size of the house and the door. Then the room is quiet while everyone thinks again. Our group finds an answer and shows the teacher. She smiles, and we are ready to try our idea.",
    "textZh": "在學校，老師給每個小組一個小任務。我坐在椅子上，移近書桌。我面前有筆記本、鉛筆和尺。我們忙著用紙做一棟小房子。我寫下我們的想法，另一位學生畫圖。我們討論房子和門的大小。接著大家再次思考，教室安靜下來。我們的小組找出答案，拿給老師看。她微笑，我們準備試試自己的想法。",
